    "title": "Robbery suspect apprehended in Quincy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brenna O'Boyle ,\n10 hours ago PLUMAS COUNTY, Calif. (KOLO) - A robbery suspect wanted out of Butte County was arrested and booked into the Plumas County Jail on Wednesday, Nov. 26, according to an agency news release. Twenty-year-old Payton Wiles of Oroville was taken into custody without incident, Plumas County Deputy Sheriff Chandler Peay said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
